        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hours of fun with friends and family!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Walls &amp; Tower amongst other board games in this collection! Bring out your laptop, gather your friends and enjoy it to the max.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868960/extras/c5623e7abc471d3e85da3dc1aa15b31a.poster.avif?t=1785619939\" width=558 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868960/extras/c5623e7abc471d3e85da3dc1aa15b31a.webm?t=1785619939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868960/extras/c5623e7abc471d3e85da3dc1aa15b31a.mp4?t=1785619939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Walls &amp; Tower -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reshape the maze</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868960/extras/947aa3cde5e7a365dff6d442bbd9e179.poster.avif?t=1785619939\" width=558 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868960/extras/947aa3cde5e7a365dff6d442bbd9e179.webm?t=1785619939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868960/extras/947aa3cde5e7a365dff6d442bbd9e179.mp4?t=1785619939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate Players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868960/extras/60868522457a616a00ae8f082f6bbc48.poster.avif?t=1785619939\" width=558 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868960/extras/60868522457a616a00ae8f082f6bbc48.webm?t=1785619939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868960/extras/60868522457a616a00ae8f082f6bbc48.mp4?t=1785619939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More to come...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A party from 2 to 6 players!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never the right amount of players? no worries! Play with up to 6 players on the same device and keep everybody engaged. Plus the more players, the funnier it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868960/extras/34e974aeb29ad3ae0be0a2c12dba0dc5.poster.avif?t=1785619939\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868960/extras/34e974aeb29ad3ae0be0a2c12dba0dc5.webm?t=1785619939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868960/extras/34e974aeb29ad3ae0be0a2c12dba0dc5.mp4?t=1785619939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You're in control!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time constraints? Not with this game. You control the rules and wining conditions for each game so you can get the maximum out of your parties.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868960/extras/7d96888bd42d3c7b0d577faf1a3def60.avif?t=1785619939\" width=800 height=451 /></span></p>",
